Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.10,0:00:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Somedays I'm treadin' the water
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.83,0:00:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel like it's getting deep
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.20,0:00:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Some nights I drown in the weight of the things that I think I need
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.26,0:00:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes I feel incomplete
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.78,0:00:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.00,0:00:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But you always say to me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.95,0:00:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Say to me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.40,0:00:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you say
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.74,0:00:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Someday when we're older
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.10,0:00:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be shinin' like we're gold
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.32,0:00:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.32,0:00:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.40,0:00:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Someday when we're older
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.20,0:00:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be yours and you'll be mine
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.19,0:00:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Be happy, happy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.50,0:00:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you say
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.63,0:00:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Someday when we're older
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.00,0:01:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't worry about the things that we don't need
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.70,0:01:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't need
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.80,0:01:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And one day down the line
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.80,0:01:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Before we both run out of time, we're gonna see
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.60,0:01:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That someday we'll be all that we need
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.40,0:01:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Someday we'll be all that we need
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.80,0:01:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been the best, been the worst
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.22,0:01:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Been a ghost in a crowded room
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.89,0:01:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah - yeah - yeah - yeah - yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.80,0:01:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I took a chance, took a turn, took a dive, and it led to you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.64,0:01:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah - yeah - yeah - yeah - yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.60,0:01:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,So many times that I wish we could be anywhere but here
